    "text": "If the minimum and the maximum values of the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> defined by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>12</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>respectively, then the ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to :"
